# The Blaine landing page owns the site root.
#
# blaine.mysalonsuite.com points at this site, so "/" must serve the live v5
# page (real booking widget), not the frozen v1 index.html.
#
# The "!" force flag is required: Netlify skips a rule when a real file already
# matches the path, and index.html exists here. Without it this rule is ignored.
#
# v1-v4 stay reachable at their own paths for the client comparison:
#   /index.html            v1 (frozen)
#   /index-v2.html         v2
#   /index-blaine-v5.html  v5 (same page the root now serves)

/    /index-blaine-v5.html    200!
